    "description": "Lesson drill: the major pentatonic (\"Country\") scale in 1st position, ascending then descending, using only natural blow/draw notes \u2014 no bending. 1 blow, 1 draw, 2 blow, 2 draw, 4 blow, 4 draw, 5 blow, 6 blow, 6 draw."
